      "party": "Democratic",
      "incumbent": true,
      "summary": "Marie Gluesenkamp Perez is the incumbent U.S. Representative for Washington's 3rd Congressional District, first elected in 2022. A small business owner who co-owns an auto repair shop in Portland, she has positioned herself as a moderate Democrat, often breaking with her party on issues such as immigration and censure votes. She was re-elected in 2024 with 51.7% of the vote, making her one of only 13 Democrats to win a district carried by Donald Trump.",
